  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#creating-a-new-browsing-context\n\nStep 1 creates a new browsing context. Per https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#popup-sandboxing-flag-set, this browsing context will have an empty popup sandboxing flag set.\n\nStep 6 determines the sandboxing flags to apply, passing in the new browsing context. Since this will lead to a meaningless check in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#determining-the-creation-sandboxing-flags, I'm pretty sure we want the browsing context of `creator` instead if it is non-null.",
